<title>UK: ICI buys Swiss transport paints business.</title>
<headline>ICI buys Swiss transport paints business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Chemical Industries Plc said on Friday that it is buying the refinish and commercial transport paints business in Switzerland of Rutz und Huber AG.</p>
<p>ICI said in a statement that the value of the transaction represents less than one percent of its net assets.</p>
<p>Rutz und Huber has an annual turnover of more than three million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
